%% Mermaid State Machine: Selection
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Hovering: mouse move + hit
  Hovering --> Selected: click
  Selected --> MultiSelecting: ctrl+click/drag
  MultiSelecting --> Selected: mouse up
  Selected --> Idle: escape/clear
